    kind: work_item  # e7a5
    title: "poll_ci hung-runner heuristic is backend-incompatible: Woodpecker posts ONE aggregate context that never goes non-pending mid-run, so every pipeline over 300s is declared hung"  # e7a5
    status: todo_hard  # e7a5
